# NarrativeNexus: Dynamic Text Analysis Platform

## 📌 Description
This project is a Dynamic Text Analysis Platform that analyzes text using Natural Language Processing (NLP) techniques.

It can detect topics, analyze sentiment, generate summaries, and provide insights from user input text.

---

## 🚀 Features
- Topic Detection
- Sentiment Analysis
- Text Summarization
- Insight & Recommendation
- Interactive Streamlit Dashboard

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- Python
- Streamlit
- TextBlob

---

## ▶️ How to Run the Project

1. Install required libraries:
pip install -r requirements.txt

2. Run the application:
streamlit run streamlit_app.py

---

## 📊 Example Input

The new iPhone has amazing features but the price is too high and users are concerned about privacy.

---

## 📈 Output
- Topic: Product Review / Technology
- Sentiment: Mixed
- Summary: Short summary of the text
- Recommendation: Suggestions based on analysis

